  MAY   25    1976

COMMENTS TO FORLIB THE FIV LIBRARY.
REFER TO OS/8 HANDBOOK PAGE 8-40.

A)COMPLEX BUT NOT DOUBLE CAN BE USED UNDER ETOS.
B)LAB ROUTINES <TIME CLOCK PLOT ADC REALTM> NOT UNDER ETOS.
  A CLOCK/TIME SUBROUTINE WILL BE AVAILABLE LATER.
C)IGNORE ANY ENTRYPOINTS IN FORLIB PRECEEDED BY #.
D)THE FOLLOWING ENTRYPOINTS ARE NOT IN THE FIV MANUAL.

1)THE SPECIAL ROUTINES

	CALL CMDOPT(I,A)	READS OPTION BIT I TO A
	DO NOT USE E(49,G(6),H(7)
	CALL SWI(6,X)		READS SR INTO BIT 6
	I=ETOS(0)
	CALL ICHAR(A1,I6)
	CALL OCHAR(A1,I6)
	CALL PDATE(UNIT,'TEXT')
	CALL BGET(A,I,L)	BIT I INTO L		ALSO BPUT
	CALL WGET(A,I,L)	WORD I IN A INTO L	ALSO WPUT

2)	THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR
	### RANDOMIZE DOES NOT WORK PROPERLY UNDER ETOS YET###

	CALL RANDU(IX,X)
	GIVES A RANDOM NUMBER (0<X<1)IN X  IX SHOULD BE USED IN FURTHER
	CALLS.

	TO RANDOMIZE SEE MANUAL.

3)	LPLOT IS IN FIV MANUAL (ELECTRONICS ARTICLE)
	NOTE CHANGE IN FIGURE ARGS

4)	NUMINT:
	PERFORMS NUMERICAL INTEGRATION
	CALL NUMINT(N,OUT,X,Y)

5)	FCDF FROM DECUSCOPE
	P=FCDF(F,M,N)
	SETS P=PROBABILITY OF F WITH M,N DEGREES OF FREEDOM

	FOR T SET M=1,F=T*T
	FOR Z SET M=1 N=INFINIT,F=Z*Z
	FOR X-2 SET M=INFINIT,F=X2/NDF

INVERSE FUNCTIONS:

	F=FINV(0.95,DF1,DF2)
	T=TINV(0.95,DF)
	Z=ZINV(0.95)

THE SSP ROUTINES IN THE LIBRARY ARE IN THE SSP MANUAL.
